  "sourceUrl": "https://openplatform.byd.com/#/document/index?id=293",
  "html": "<h1 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>『美的』两用双温冰箱</strong></span></h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/0472d3a2aee24891ad01ebebf31faa6c.png?auth_key=1795678278-6d80ce794c064bfb9cc4ca3c22beb58c-0-5ea44c26789aea3e6acb67203899b39e02c7cd26e267db3d49f0d0449182b4f2\" alt=\"image.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 435.12px;height: 718.25px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">图 1-1 美的两用双温冰箱</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">美的两用双温冰箱，通过蓝牙协议接入“智慧物联APP”，用户通过车机大屏，操控冰箱冷冻启停、调温、模式切换功能。同时为用户提供各类场景自动化功能，用户在“智慧物联APP”场景中配置冰箱联动。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/5f96352b4bed4ca4984ac1116e2a4f42.png?auth_key=1795678278-225ad222ff8a4a639cc16562fb369041-0-f1c64f1d4d14c7317c82d970e093f63973724e658157fbcf4e8815a469f11d56\" alt=\"image.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 461.12px;height: 761.17px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">图 1-2 车机操控冰箱</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1. &nbsp;车机大屏控制</strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机大屏控制冰箱的功能有：</span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">冰箱</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">冷冻启停</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">温度显示、调节（</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">-20℃～20℃</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">）；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">强劲制冷/节能制冷模式切换；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">温标切换；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">电源低压保护选择；</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/cbac0a1064844f5e98befa13bb9458dd.png?auth_key=1795678278-6d1c6396d7ad4c9a8ce3b20934f5dc63-0-6bcc14f9a5165e7a55e589565559921194b320b68c8328c82877d13a2487ebf6\" alt=\"image.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 778.12px;height: 437.68px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-3 车机大屏操控</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2. &nbsp;场景自动化功能</strong></span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">用户在</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机端</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">“智慧物联APP”场景中，可以根据需要配置冰箱联动。</span></p>"
}
